{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13216130","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13216130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321613001:1":{"text":"여기... 바로 여기야! 여기에 우리 집이 있어...","source_cn":"这里……是这里！我的家在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08CA68A49CAEEC06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321613002:0":{"text":"정말요?! 어느 집이에요?!","source_cn":"真的？！是哪一间房子？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6254DEF982580348","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321613003:1":{"text":"없어... 우리 집이 없어...","source_cn":"没有……没有我家的房子了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EF38C29F101513E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321613004:0":{"text":"나... 집을 떠난 지 너무 오래됐어... 어머니, 아버지, 조아...","source_cn":"我……我离开家，究竟多久了……母亲，父亲，佐娅……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA963CC7EAEE6489E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321613005:1":{"text":"데미, 너무 속상해하지 마요...","source_cn":"德米，别太伤心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30EC5AAD8130B536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321613006:1":{"text":"...소리가 들려, 익숙한 소리야.\n누가 나를 부르고 있어...!","source_cn":"……有声音，熟悉的声音。\\n有人在呼唤我……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE2F6EC34D798787","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321613007:0":{"text":"대성당... 대성당에서 들리는 소리야...!","source_cn":"教堂……是从教堂传来的……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63AD5A8DC5DAF85D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321613008:1":{"text":"잠깐! 지금 유령인데 대성당에는 어떻게 가려고요?!","source_cn":"等等——！你现在是幽灵啊，怎么能跑去教堂——？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40C3D642DD7814FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:幽灵德米":{"text":"유령 데미","source":"幽灵德米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}